---
// PilotSteps.astro — extraído de Pilot.astro
---

<!-- ==============================================
     BLOQUE 2: METODOLOGÍA PRÁCTICA EN 3 PASOS
     ============================================== -->
<div class="pilot-methodology-section" data-reveal="editorial">
  <div class="methodology-header">
    <div class="eyebrow-wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="eyebrow-text">PUESTA EN MARCHA</span>
    </div>
    <h3 class="methodology-title">
      Cómo ponemos en marcha DECA Light con tu equipo
    </h3>
    <p class="methodology-sub">
      Un proceso estructurado, discreto y sin fricción para no interrumpir la operativa habitual de tus muelles de carga.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="steps-grid" role="list" aria-label="Fases de la puesta en marcha">
    <!-- Paso 01 -->
    <article class="step-card group" role="listitem" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="1">
      <div class="step-top-content">
        <div class="step-card-header">
          <span class="step-num">01</span>
          <div class="step-icon-box" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18"></line>
              <path d="M12 6v6l3-3"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h4 class="step-title">Conocemos tu operativa</h4>
        <p class="step-desc">
          Entendemos cómo gestionáis los albaranes, las cartas de porte, los datos del transporte y la documentación de las expediciones de cada salida.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-footer">
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="footer-icon-green" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
          <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
        </svg>
        <span>Sesión de 30 min sin compromiso</span>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Paso 02 -->
    <article class="step-card group" role="listitem" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="2">
      <div class="step-top-content">
        <div class="step-card-header">
          <span class="step-num">02</span>
          <div class="step-icon-box" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"></line>
              <line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"></line>
              <line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h4 class="step-title">Configuramos tu cuenta</h4>
        <p class="step-desc">
          Damos de alta tus centros de carga y transportistas y conectamos el informe de expediciones de tu ERP.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-footer">
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="footer-icon-green" aria-hidden="true">
          <line x1="4" y1="21" x2="4" y2="14"></line>
          <line x1="4" y1="10" x2="4" y2="3"></line>
          <line x1="12" y1="21" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
          <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="3"></line>
          <line x1="20" y1="21" x2="20" y2="16"></line>
          <line x1="20" y1="12" x2="20" y2="3"></line>
          <line x1="1" y1="14" x2="7" y2="14"></line>
          <line x1="9" y1="8" x2="15" y2="8"></line>
          <line x1="17" y1="16" x2="23" y2="16"></line>
        </svg>
        <span>Configuración inicial</span>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Paso 03 -->
    <article class="step-card group" role="listitem" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="3">
      <div class="step-top-content">
        <div class="step-card-header">
          <span class="step-num">03</span>
          <div class="step-icon-box" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z"></path>
              <path d="m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z"></path>
              <path d="M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0"></path>
              <path d="M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h4 class="step-title">Arranque acompañado</h4>
        <p class="step-desc">
          Empezáis a trabajar con DECA Light con nuestro acompañamiento, en paralelo a vuestro sistema actual hasta que lo deis por bueno.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-footer">
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="footer-icon-green" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="m11 17 2 2a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l4.58-4.58a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.42l-2-2"></path>
          <path d="m3 11 4.58-4.58a1 1 0 0 1 1.42 0l2 2a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.42L6.42 14.42a1 1 0 0 1-1.42 0l-2-2a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.42z"></path>
        </svg>
        <span>Seguimiento cercano</span>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</div>


<style>
  .eyebrow-wrap {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
  .eyebrow-line {
      width: 1.5rem;
      height: 2px;
      background-color: var(--palette-deca-800);
      border-radius: 9999px;
    }
  .eyebrow-text {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: var(--palette-deca-800);
    }
  .pilot-methodology-section {
      width: 100%;
      padding-top: 1rem;
    }
  .methodology-header {
      max-width: 48rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }
  .methodology-title {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      line-height: 1.25;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--palette-slate-900);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .methodology-title {
          font-size: 2rem;
        }
  }
  .methodology-sub {
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--palette-slate-600);
    }
  .steps-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .steps-grid {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        }
  }
  .step-card {
      background-color: var(--palette-white);
      border: 1px solid var(--palette-slate-200);
      border-radius: 1.5rem;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 0.35s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
    }
  .step-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 32px -4px rgba(8, 84, 62, 0.08), 0 6px 12px -2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
      border-color: rgba(8, 84, 62, 0.25);
    }
  .step-card-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
  .step-num {
      font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--palette-emerald-900);
      transition: transform 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
    }
  .step-card:hover .step-num {
      color: var(--palette-deca-800);
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }
  .step-icon-box {
      width: 2.375rem;
      height: 2.375rem;
      border-radius: 0.875rem;
      background-color: var(--palette-emerald-50);
      color: var(--palette-deca-800);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), background-color 0.3s ease;
    }
  .step-card:hover .step-icon-box {
      transform: scale(1.1) rotate(2deg);
      background-color: var(--palette-emerald-100);
    }
  .step-title {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.3;
      color: var(--palette-slate-900);
      margin-bottom: 0.625rem;
    }
  .step-desc {
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--palette-slate-600);
    }
  .step-footer {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      padding-top: 1rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--palette-slate-100);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--palette-slate-500);
    }
  .footer-icon-green {
      color: var(--palette-deca-800);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    *, ::before, ::after {
          animation-duration: 0.001ms !important;
          animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
          transition-duration: 0.001ms !important;
          scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        }
  }
</style>
